flowchart LR
  Agent[Frontier Agent]\n(Read-Only Tool Calls)
  APEX[APEX Shared Context Console]\n(Human Validation UI)
  ORDS[ORDS Shared Context Module]\n(/context/*)
  DB[(Oracle Database 23ai)]
  Rel[(Relational Tables\nCases/Experiments/Samples/Reports/Audit)]
  Vec[(Vector Evidence\nEvidence Chunks + Embeddings)]
  Cache[(Optional Oracle True Cache)]

  Agent -->|GET/POST JSON| ORDS
  APEX -->|SQL Views + API Parity| ORDS
  APEX -->|Interactive Reports| DB
  ORDS -->|SQL + JSON_OBJECT| DB
  DB --> Rel
  DB --> Vec
  ORDS -. optional read-through .-> Cache
  Cache -. cache miss .-> DB
